$Module simple 3 "Simple Golang VMOD Example"

$Function STRING hello(STRING name)
Description: Returns a greeting message with the provided name.
Example: simple.hello("World")

$Function INT add(INT a, INT b)
Description: Adds two integers and returns the result.
Example: simple.add(5, 3) 

$Function VOID write(HEADER h)
Description: Writes a header to file.
Example: simple.write(req.http.X-Greeting)
